    "animation": "0–3s: Wieslaw slowly pushes the wheelbarrow one short step toward camera, hands remaining below the lower edge; his shoulders sway subtly with the effort. 3–8s: he settles, glances down once and exhales through his nose, maintaining a weary matter-of-fact expression. Camera tracks backward gently to keep the same chest-up framing and sharp face throughout. Background inspector draws a short length of violet tape; chairwoman remains studying rubble; photographer presses the Leica shutter once. Preserve all four identities, natural anatomy, clothing, left-chest badges and camera. Background remains softly focused. Ruined walls, broken beam remnants, open sky, rubble and curtains remain fixed in constant daylight. No roof reconstruction, further collapse, new people, angel, extra limbs, facial morph, cuts, captions or watermarks. @Image1 man is mumbilng with disgusted face expression."
